  "content": "<p><em>此資源包是在我開發整合包「<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/mechanized-rat\" rel=\"nofollow\">機械化老鼠</a>」期間製作的。</em></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2>JourneyMap 擴展生物圖標</h2>\n<p>為多個模組添加了 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap</a> 的生物圖標。</p>\n<h2>支援的模組</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquaculture 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critters-and-companions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Critters and Companions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecologics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecologics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ydms-fennec-fox\" rel=\"nofollow\">YDM's Fennec Fox</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturalist\" rel=\"nofollow\">Naturalist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rotten-creatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rotten Creatures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/untitled-duck-mod-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Untitled Duck Mod</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unusual-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waddles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-wild-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Wild Backport</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>展示</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/821/916/difference_banner.png\" alt=\"遊戲內展示\"></p>\n<h2>兼容性</h2>\n<p>適用於 <strong>JourneyMap 5.3+</strong> 的生物圖標格式。這意味著所有 <strong>1.10</strong> 之後的 Minecraft 版本都兼容此資源包。</p>\n<h2>擴展模組支援（針對整合包開發者）</h2>\n<p>若要添加自定義圖標，請參見 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fteamjm.github.io%252fjourneymap-docs%252flatest%252fTools%2band%2bCustomisation%252fcustom-mob-icons%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 JourneyMap 文檔</a>。圖標可以添加到相同的資源包中，模仿現有模組的結構，或者打包為獨立的資源包。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
